# Change Log

## 2026-06-08

- Further reduction: `require_cms_user` / `CmsUser` Depends in `app/routers/cms.py` (removed auth boilerplate from protected routes); merged `bootstrap_login.html.j2` into `login.html.j2` with `bootstrap` flag; added `cms/base.html.j2` for shared nav/CSS in articles/users templates.
- Repo: unified `list_visible_articles(db, paths_only=...)`; removed `cms_user_exists` (use `get_cms_user`); `update_article_meta` now returns updated row.
- Publish: added `publish_article_removed`; `sync_visibility_to_disk` delegates to `publish_article_change` for non-menu/footer paths.

## 2026-06-08 (refactor)

- Tests: added `tests/support.py` with shared helpers; refactored all four test modules; trimmed redundant asserts in `test_article_rendering.py`.
- Publish: added `publish_article_change` and `_write_article_index_with_db` in `app/services/publish.py`; replaced duplicate publish blocks in `app/routers/cms.py` and `app/verstka_handlers.py`; `articles_create` now uses return value of `repo.insert_article`.
- Validation: added `app/validation.py` with shared `is_valid_email`; removed duplicate regex from `cms.py` and `verstka_handlers.py`.
- Cleanup: removed unused `storage_fonts_dir` from `app/paths.py`; removed unused `app.state.settings` / `app.state.storage` from `app/main.py`; dropped unused `settings` param from `_menu_footer_blocks`; avoided double `is_current_verstka_article_html` call in `app/services/render.py`.

## 2026-06-08 (earlier)

- Removed `/confs/` nginx route, `confs/` directory, and related README documentation (unrelated to CMS demo).

## 2026-04-24

- Added nginx handling for `/confs/*.conf` in `staff/nginx.conf`, serving files from `/var/www/demo-cms/confs/`.
- Documented the `/confs/*.conf` nginx behavior in `README.md`.

## 2026-04-25

- CMS bootstrap: when `ADMINS` is empty and `cms_users` is empty, `/cms/login` shows first-admin form; POST writes `ADMINS` to `.env` (argon2 hash), clears `get_settings` cache, sets session `bootstrap_pending_restart`, shows restart instructions (`app/routers/cms.py`, `app/env_bootstrap.py`, templates `cms/bootstrap_*.html.j2`).
- Added `repo.count_cms_users` for bootstrap detection.
- README: documented first run without `ADMINS`.
- Translated `README.md` and all Jinja2 CMS/article templates to English; aligned login/bootstrap error strings in `app/routers/cms.py`.

## 2026-04-26

- Added `Settings.debug` / env `DEBUG`; when true, `DebugRequestLoggingMiddleware` in `app/debug_request_logging.py` logs HTTP request/response headers and truncated bodies to stdout; wired in `app/main.py` after `SessionMiddleware`. Documented in `README.md` and `.env.example`.
- Verstka: strip `VERSTKA_API_KEY` / `VERSTKA_API_SECRET` / `VERSTKA_CALLBACK_URL` on load; pass `debug=settings.debug` into `VerstkaConfig` for richer callback signature errors. README: `invalid_signature` troubleshooting.
